  cos1 high and cos2 low, on blocks where w2 is appreciable, means the
  degree-2 drift was fed noise and T7 measured an ESTIMATOR failure rather
  than a mechanism failure. cos2 rising with shots would then give the
  budget at which the degree-2 oracle becomes usable - and that number is
  the actual deliverable, because it prices the upgrade.
